      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "In plain English, the \"Residuals\" clause allows you to retain and use some insights or patterns (specifically, optimization techniques) gained from the confidential information in your mind, without revealing the confidential information itself. Think of it like a \"mental takeaway\" clause. You can use these adaptations in future projects, as long as you don't disclose the original confidential information you were trained on.",
